{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1352619-what-are-your-funny-stories-from-your-demon-the-descent-games","id":1352619,"title":"What are your funny stories from your Demon the Descent games?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-12-04T09:18:31-08:00","id":1352619,"title":"What are your funny stories from your Demon the Descent games?","content":"Was wondering what funny stories people have from playing DtD. I\u2019m still trying to get my campaign off the ground, but would love to hear other people\u2019s stories.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25291-donteatrawhagis","name":"DontEatRawHagis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"211"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-04T10:27:26-08:00","id":1352636,"title":"","content":"I play in a mixed genre game where we have other Supernaturals in the game. I had a cover where I changed from playing a Mage to a Demon. Since I played both characters, I worked it out with the ST to say that the Demon made a pact with the Mage and eventually took position of the Soul Pact.<br /> <br /> It took maybe another 12 to 16 sessions before most people figured out that I was no longer playing a Mage but a Demon instead. I really got to play the &quot;spy&quot; for a while. What's more, I had my &quot;fall&quot; because I was sent to kill a PC (Vampire) but wanted to kill all of them, thereby doubting the God-Machine's orders. Later, the ST sent another Angel to come after him. So the player knew it was me... but his character didn't. THAT was extremely funny for everyone but him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":14512,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14512-ghostdriver","user":"Ghostdriver","date":". 01-30-2020, 09:42 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14512-ghostdriver","name":"Ghostdriver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14512_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T15:06:24-08:00","id":1353159,"title":"","content":"Once had a game where a player possed a werewolf that was pretty damn funny lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T15:29:29-08:00","id":1353168,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1352619-what-are-your-funny-stories-from-your-demon-the-descent-games?p=1353159#post1353159\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Once had a game where a player possed a werewolf that was pretty damn funny lol</div> </div> </div> </div>Lol! They must have wrecked some enemies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25291-donteatrawhagis","name":"DontEatRawHagis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"211"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-23T18:39:01-08:00","id":1356735,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DontEatRawHagis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1352619-what-are-your-funny-stories-from-your-demon-the-descent-games?p=1353168#post1353168\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Lol! They must have wrecked some enemies.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Oh yeah they did it was pretty funny. It was a werewolf assassin","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-24T18:04:30-08:00","id":1356869,"title":"","content":"I was in a game where my gadgeteer Demon was running a second hand shop (easy front for getting new gadgets to analyze or to sell to others) and a Hunter of sorts wandered in. He had previously been harrassing a Werewolf player character but never quite seemed to know if she was one or not. When he came into my business asking strange questions, I managed to foist him onto an old, small television I claimed was making strange whispers at midnight. He bought it, in more ways than one. Sadly that game didn't last too much longer after that due to various issues, but the ST did a really nice job for a game they weren't used to. They certainly knew how to make a lot of random but interesting gadgets for me to examine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-29T16:19:31-08:00","id":1364059,"title":"","content":"My game turned into a drama in which two of the characters ended up pregnant, one of the father's being one who was in a committed relationship already. The sequel campaign is being set in 2035, where the characters are all the grown-up children of the previous characters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25927-lolotovcocktail","name":"LolotovCocktail","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}